        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "fL94q",
          "name": "Annotations",
          "width": 1440,
          "height": 0,
          "content": "[DataTable] Monthly list → @shadcn/table DataTable pattern\n[matrix: 7d×3shifts] Weekly assignments = 21 columns (expert × day × shift)\n[HARDCODED] All column headers need i18n keys\nMonth/Year selector reused from Invoice List pattern\nToolbar: View/Edit open InvoiceDetails dialog cross-module\n[async: poll job status] ZIP Download triggers background job with polling dialog"
        }
      ]
    }
